info: Audit.lean:26:0: def Erdos882Trial.admissibleFamily : ℕ → Finset (Finset ℕ) :=
fun n => Finset.filter (Admissible n) (Finset.Icc 1 n).powerset
info: Audit.lean:27:0: def Erdos882Trial.maximumSize : ℕ → ℕ :=
